/tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335A840" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335AAA0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335AD00"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335AF60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335B410"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335B670"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335B8D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335BB30" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335C360"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335C5C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Agency Partner,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335CA80"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335CCE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335D1A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335D400" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for using the NDC Technical Support Contact Us form.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013359F00"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335D660">Based on our initial investigation, it appears that the content you believe you should have access to is only available for Premium NDC members.&nbsp;<br><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335D9B0">Please speak with your commercial/supplier relationship team in relation to this request and ask them to contact your Qantas Account Manager to discuss further.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F6B18E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013524240"></font><p class="MsoNormal">For more information on Qantas&nbsp;NDC and frequently asked
questions, please visit <a href="https://help.qantas.com/agencyconnect/s/topic/0TOMo000000MuMvOAK/qantas-ndc">NDC
FAQ</a>.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335E050">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335E290"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335E3A0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335E5E0">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335E840"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335EA80">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335F070"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335F2D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335F790"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001335F9F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000133614C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013361720" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013361980" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013361BE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013361E40"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000133620A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013362300" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013362560"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000133627C0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013362A20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-